{"t": 1793690620.260708, "s": 0.27, "code": "import numpy as np\nnp.set_printoptions(precision=4, suppress=True, linewidth=200)\nfor k in sorted(W):\n    a=W[k]\n    print(k, a.shape, 'norm', float(np.linalg.norm(a)), 'mean', float(a.mean()), 'std', float(a.std()), 'min', float(a.min()), 'max', float(a.max()))\nprint('\\nPer-layer matrix norms:')\nfor l in range(4):\n    print('layer',l)\n    for nm in ['W_q','W_k','W_v','W_o','W_fc','W_proj']:\n        a=W[f'{nm}.{l}']\n        s=np.linalg.svd(a, compute_uv=False)\n        print(nm,'norm',np.linalg.norm(a),'sing',s[:10], 'rank99', np.searchsorted(np.cumsum(s*s)/np.sum(s*s),.99)+1)\n    print('ln1_w',W[f'ln1_w.{l}'])\n    print('ln1_b',W[f'ln1_b.{l}'])\n    print('ln2_w',W[f'ln2_w.{l}'])\n    print('ln2_b',W[f'ln2_b.{l}'])\n", "out": "W_fc.0 (1536, 384) norm 46.24861145019531 mean -0.001180821331217885 std 0.060207970440387726 min -0.7368497252464294 max 0.8575737476348877\nW_fc.1 (1536, 384) norm 79.12654113769531 mean -0.000402381963795051 std 0.1030285656452179 min -0.7885797619819641 max 0.7180054187774658\nW_fc.2 (1536, 384) norm 78.96681213378906 mean -0.0003366385353729129 std 0.10282080620527267 min -0.8970372676849365 max 1.2283228635787964\nW_fc.3 (1536, 384) norm 77.77581787109375 mean -5.819168654852547e-05 std 0.10127057880163193 min -0.4879089891910553 max 1.0584442615509033\nW_k.0 (384, 384) norm 30.390932083129883 mean -0.00011999023263342679 std 0.07914295792579651 min -0.8677226901054382 max 0.9180701971054077\nW_k.1 (384, 384) norm 29.250640869140625 mean 6.702466635033488e-06 std 0.07617354393005371 min -1.018454909324646 max 0.9855566620826721\nW_k.2 (384, 384) norm 37.76884078979492 mean 3.2408072001999244e-05 std 0.09835635125637054 min -1.4294401407241821 max 1.307726263999939\nW_k.3 (384, 384) norm 32.20944595336914 mean -0.00010883560025831684 std 0.08387869596481323 min -0.9338246583938599 max 0.8848811984062195\nW_o.0 (384, 384) norm 16.371328353881836 mean -0.00011180931323906407 std 0.0